    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: any swamps or grave fields.\n\nGhostpetal bears drooping grey flowers that are almost indistinguishable from mist in poor light. The petals turn translucent when bruised and leave a cool, faintly luminous film upon the skin, although the sheen vanishes when viewed directly. Grave-tenders sometimes plant it along cemetery walls, believing that its presence quietens restless spirits. For 10 minutes, you gain a +2-item bonus to Stealth checks made in dim light or darkness.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
